# apps/web

Antes de editar, leé:

1. `.agents/skills/tailwind-design-system/SKILL.md`
2. `.agents/skills/atomic-design-fundamentals/SKILL.md`
3. `.agents/skills/linear-ui-skills/SKILL.md` (tokens / dark tool)
4. `.agents/skills/web-design-guidelines/SKILL.md`
5. Si tocás lógica React: `.agents/skills/vercel-react-best-practices/SKILL.md`

## Convenciones

- Estilos solo con **Tailwind v4** (`@theme` en `src/index.css`).
- Componentes en `atoms` → `molecules` → `organisms` → `templates`; pantallas en `pages/`.
- Reutilizar `cn()` de `src/lib/cn.ts`.
- No recrear `App.css` BEM.
- Dirección visual: `project-hub-docs/04-ui-ux/direccion-visual-2026.md`.
